35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is just plasterboard. I can hear everything.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We paid 68,000 yen last year for nine small bookings.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. That is too long.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The only unplanned talk is by the printer now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Two people used the room eleven times. The rest, four.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, that invoice amount is high for such small groups.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, yes. And the fridge clear-out was done twice by one person.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
