44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Toshio, the facilities callouts were eleven. The store room had none.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we make it a meeting space, the noise stays in.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
