47,2,3,talk,Rin,,A kitchen would let us eat together. That feels right.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room might help, but we need to talk, not hide.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The meeting space quote is higher. Is it worth the hours?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,I prefer the meeting space. It solves the noise issue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am hesitant. The cost is significant.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for the kitchen. We need to eat together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,I agree with Rin. Connection is key.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will think about the hours. The meeting space seems logical.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
